  "problem": "The function $f(x),$ defined as\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{k}{\\sqrt{8x+3}}+2,\\,x>-\\frac{3}{8}\n$$\n\nhas an inverse function given by \n\n$$\n{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{9}{2(x-2)^{2}}-\\frac{3}{8},\\,x>2.\n$$\n\nWhat is the value of $k?$ Assume that $k>0.$\n\n$k=$\n{{field-1}}",
